: 1778874439, "timestamp_updated": 1778874439, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502292037010192871", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225524266", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070686394", "personaname": "Risk", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198070686394/", "num_games_owned": 286, "num_reviews": 68, "playtime_forever": 736, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 498, "deck_playtime_at_review": 66, "last_played": 1781750052, "avatar": "7e64e4a94789309cc57c75fc7ff1d518eea0bd48"}, "language": "english", "review": "Super satisfying wave combat, it's really fun to mow through xenomorphs with smart guns, shotguns, and missiles. I love the different challenge cards and how they can impact your run but give you more rewards for enduring those risks like losing ammo when reloading un-empty mags, or bullet jams. It gets high adrenaline once the elite xenomorphs start to show up compared to the basic xenomorphs which keeps you on your toes if you let it escape the encounter to fight you again or aren't ready to handle such a threat in the moment. The smart gun is so satisfying to use just staring down hallways, the story is pretty decent in itself as well.\n\nThis review has been funded by Weyland-Yutani.", "timestamp_created": 1778808561, "timestamp_updated": 1778808561, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "hardware": {"system_ram": "16315", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 5 3600X 6-Core Processor             ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Ti", "vram_size": 5966}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225523350", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028078697", "personaname": "SenatorIvy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SenatorIvy/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 5628, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 335, "playtime_at_review": 232, "last_played": 1787467094, "avatar": "bf0baac0e9df488a46b50efc33643a9ac0edb66e"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's no Zombie Army 4 but it's fun and it's a good Aliens experience you can play with friends so I am enjoying it.", "timestamp_created": 1778807539, "timestamp_updated": 1778807539, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225518162", "author": {"steamid": "76561198034821974", "personaname": "NathanYaMutt", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/NathanYaMutt/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1520, "playtime_forever": 405, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 405, "last_played": 1778801500, "avatar": "3ced6cdf3fd56c8005cd046ba275eed3a31fa4bd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Coming from finishing both Isolation and Colonial Marines, It was a bit of adjustment due to the third person aspect. But overall I enjoyed my experience playing fireteam elite. I do have to say I didn't get to play with anyone else because I have no friends and I didn't have any luck matching with any other players. But thank god the AI bots are solid enough to play by yourself. That said, you get different classes which of course I went gunner. My favourite type of play style, Running and shooting. Finished this quite quickly which there being four main arcs with three chapters each in them and taking around 20-40 minutes each. If you can get a group together to play this, I highly suggest you do so and try the hard setting because my lord its hard.", "timestamp_created": 1778802019, "timestamp_updated": 1778802081, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 20, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.731970727443695068", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 26, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 32, "count": 1}]}]}